{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John in Peru"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Adventures in Travel"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Exploring Ancient Sites > Machu Picchu"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Imperial system"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the measurement system used in the United States and England"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We use the Imperial system, so I don't know how many kilometers it is."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use on a bus ride."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "twisty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a lot of turns in the road"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The roads are very twisty."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "traffic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "vehicles on the road"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a lot of traffic on the roads in Peru."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "village"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area smaller than a town"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many villages along the road to Machu Picchu."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "weather permitting"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "if the weather allows"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can go hiking tomorrow, weather permitting."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "That depends on\u2026 "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the situation relies on another situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That depends on how fast you climb!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le15ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le15ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Saying How Far a Place Is"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to know how far a place is, you can use the question:<span class=\"italic\"> How far is\u2026?</span><br> You can reply with a specific distance if you know the answer, like <span class=\"italic\">It's 50 yards away.</span><br><br> The United States uses the Imperial system, not the metric system.<br><br>If a place is nearby, you use yards to say how far it is.<br> If a place is far, you use miles to say how far it is."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imperial System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Metric System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 mile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1.6 kilometers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I yard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"90 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 foot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"30 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 inch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2.5 centimeters\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Wh-Hw Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use Wh-Hw Questions to get specific information about people, places and things. You often ask these when you travel somewhere new. <br>Wh-Hw Questions are also called Information Questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\